= Mobilise the Free Worlds

Alderaan, Corellia, Chandrila and the other Defence Pact worlds can bring their forces to readiness, if they are told to.

- @do: Mobilise the Free Worlds.
- @easy_discard

@do
on-arrival: member_forces += 1; fear += 1

Quietly, the Pact's squadrons move to readiness. If the worst comes, the Senate will not be alone.
